      <description>
        <![CDATA[ <p>Welcome back! This week, we're sharing our favorite products of the week (and yes, Nate's is packed with protein...), some of the unique challenges of building a celebrity brand, the inside scoop on the new Non-Ultraprocessed Food Verification, the weirdly big business of hand sanitizer, and more!</p><p></p><p><strong>The breakdown:</strong>00:00 Favorite bites of the week04:56 Building the "perfect" celeb CPG brand12:32 The new Non-Ultra Processed Food Certification18:56 Elf's first-ever fragrance23:23 Ulta's new wellness "shop-in-shops"27:18 The big biz of hand sanitizer34:54 P&G acquires the new-age Tums (Wonderbelly)39:44 Outro</p><p><strong>🎧 Love the show?</strong> Subscribe to The Curious Consumer wherever you get your podcasts! New episodes drop weekly. </p><p><strong>📧 Get the inside scoop</strong> Subscribe to <a target="_blank" href="https://open.substack.com/pub/expresscheckout">Express Checkout</a>, our newsletter packed with consumer insights, trends, and exclusive content straight to your inbox at <a target="_blank" href="http://expresscheckout.co">expresscheckout.co</a>.</p><p><strong>Let’s connect!</strong> Follow us for behind-the-scenes content, quick tips, and more: <a target="_blank" href="http://instagram.com/expresscheckout"><strong>@expresscheckout</strong></a></p><p><strong>💬 Join the conversation</strong> Have a product you’re curious about? DM us your questions or drop them in the comments—your topic could be featured in our next episode! If you have any thoughts/questions/suggestions, feel free to email us at <strong>erickumanchuk@houseedge.ai</strong> :)</p><p><strong>⭐ Help us grow</strong> If you enjoyed this episode, please rate and review us on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. It helps other curious consumers find us!</p> <br/><br/>Get full access to Express Checkout at <a href="https://expresscheckout.co/subscribe?utm_medium=podcast&#38;utm_campaign=CTA_4">expresscheckout.co/subscribe</a> ]]>
