    <item>
      <title>
        <![CDATA[ A year in consumer brands + retail: 2025 in review ]]>
      </title>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[ <p>Welcome to our final podcast of 2025! We’re walking through some of the biggest themes and headlines from the year, from redefining “function” (with protein, THC, and caffeine) to the new target demographics for skincare + fragrance and the future of retail. Thank you for being a listener this year—we are so grateful, and can’t wait to continue providing more for you in 2026. If there’s anything else you’d like to see from us next year, feel free to reach out at <a target="_blank" href="mailto:erickumanchuk@houseedge.ai">erickumanchuk@houseedge.ai</a> 😊</p><p>* Want to dig deeper into the protein trend? Check out our two protein podcast episodes: <a target="_blank" href="https://expresscheckout.co/p/protein-is-not-a-trend">https://expresscheckout.co/p/protein-is-not-a-trend</a> and <a target="_blank" href="https://expresscheckout.co/p/proteins-new-era">https://expresscheckout.co/p/proteins-new-era</a></p><p>* Looking for more info on energy drinks? We got a pod on that too: <a target="_blank" href="https://expresscheckout.co/p/energy-drinks-are-for-the-girls">https://expresscheckout.co/p/energy-drinks-are-for-the-girls</a></p><p>* And if you’re trying to check out all of the major headlines and themes from 202, snoop through our archive of newsletters at https://expresscheckout.co/archive</p><p><strong>The Rundown</strong></p><p>00:00 Intro</p><p>01:58 Biggest theme of 2025: Redefining “function”</p><p>02:52 Proteinification</p><p>06:21 Energy drinks (are for the girls)</p><p>08:55 THC category boom</p><p>10:26 Magnesium/sleep</p><p>13:04 The next gen of retail</p><p>20:37 Teens and men: The new targets of beauty/skincare</p><p>27:00 How the big guys streamlined</p><p>29:08 The crazy headlines you probably forgot</p><p>36:37 Winners of 2025</p><p>44:12 2026 predictions</p><p>49:08 Bye 2025!!!</p><p><strong>🎧 Love the show?</strong> Subscribe to The Curious Consumer wherever you get your podcasts! New episodes drop weekly. </p><p><strong>📧 Get the inside scoop</strong> Subscribe to <a target="_blank" href="https://open.substack.com/pub/expresscheckout">Express Checkout</a>, our newsletter packed with consumer insights, trends, and exclusive content straight to your inbox at <a target="_blank" href="http://expresscheckout.co">expresscheckout.co</a>.</p><p><strong>Let’s connect!</strong> Follow us for behind-the-scenes content, quick tips, and more: <a target="_blank" href="http://instagram.com/expresscheckout"><strong>@expresscheckout</strong></a></p><p><strong>💬 Join the conversation</strong> Have a product you’re curious about? DM us your questions or drop them in the comments—your topic could be featured in our next episode! If you have any thoughts/questions/suggestions, feel free to email us at erickumanchuk@houseedge.ai :)</p><p><strong>⭐ Help us grow</strong> If you enjoyed this episode, please rate and review us on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. It helps other curious consumers find us!</p> <br/><br/>Get full access to Express Checkout at <a href="https://expresscheckout.co/subscribe?utm_medium=podcast&#38;utm_campaign=CTA_4">expresscheckout.co/subscribe</a> ]]>
