      </title>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[ <p>Welcome back to another episode of The Curious Consumer! </p><p>This is our part 2 episode of our dive into protein. If you haven’t watched our first one, you can check that out <a target="_blank" href="https://expresscheckout.co/p/protein-is-not-a-trend?r=2r0jyk">here</a>! </p><p>Protein isn’t just for bodybuilders anymore. It’s everywhere. It’s in your cereal, your ice cream, even your condiments. I know. 🥣🍦🥨</p><p>This week on The Curious Consumer, we’re diving deep into the “protein-ification” of America. From wild grocery store finds to hot takes from real listeners, we’re breaking down why everyone’s obsessed, what’s actually healthy, and which trends might be here to stay.</p><p>💬 Is protein a trend, a bubble, or the new normal?</p><p>👀 Are you team “protein in everything” or “just give me the real thing”?</p><p></p><p><strong>In this episode you’ll learn about:</strong></p><p>🥣 How protein-packed products are taking over every aisle, from cereal to ice cream</p><p>🧬 Some science (and myths) behind protein claims and labeling</p><p>🍦 The rise of high-protein snacks, drinks, and even condiments</p><p>💪 Why “baddies are eating like rottweilers” and what that says about wellness culture</p><p>🤔 Hot takes from real listeners on whether protein is a trend, a bubble, or here to stay</p><p><strong>TIMESTAMPS</strong></p><p>00:00 Intro and Welcome</p><p>02:35 Brief Background and History of Protein</p><p>07:35 Exploring Protein Product Categories</p><p>08:49 Cereal Category Deep Dive</p><p>12:37 Pasta and Alternative Grains</p><p>17:18 Ice Cream and Frozen Products</p><p>19:06 Beverages and RTD Products</p><p>33:22 Hot Takes from Listeners</p><p>33:23 Consumer Hot Takes and Opinions</p><p>47:33 Future Trends and Market Predictions</p><p>56:12 Marketing Claims and Consumer Education</p><p>01:01:20 Product Quality and Taste Considerations</p><p>01:04:37 Wrap Up and Contact Information</p><p><strong>🎧 Love the show?</strong> Subscribe to The Curious Consumer wherever you get your podcasts! New episodes drop every week</p><p><strong>📧 Get the inside scoop</strong> Subscribe to <a target="_blank" href="https://open.substack.com/pub/expresscheckout">Express Checkout</a>, our newsletter packed with consumer insights, trends, and exclusive content straight to your inbox. Sign up at expresscheckout.co</p><p><strong>📱 Let’s connect!</strong> Follow us for behind-the-scenes content, quick tips, and more:</p><p>* Instagram: <a target="_blank" href="http://instagram.com/expresscheckout"><strong>@expresscheckout</strong></a></p><p><strong>💬 Join the conversation</strong> Have a product you’re curious about? DM us your questions or drop them in the comments—your topic could be featured in our next episode!</p><p><strong>⭐ Help us grow</strong> If you enjoyed this episode, please rate and review us on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. It helps other curious consumers find us!</p><p><strong>🎯 Got a minute?</strong> Share this episode with a friend who’s always reaching for that energy drink. They might learn something that surprises them!</p><p><strong>Checkout some of the articles and resources we used!</strong></p><p>* <a target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SCkP9VVxKSE">Drew Gooden’s video</a></p><p>* <a target="_blank" href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1471015323000363">Research paper on social media usage leading to increased protein intake</a></p><p>* <a target="_blank" href="https://substack.com/profile/42954029-vasa">Vasa</a>’s article on Protein bars:</p><p>* Fred Hart’s <a target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/fredwhart_costco-protein-cpg-activity-7378413321156341760-5yAe?utm_source=share&#38;utm_medium=member_desktop&#38;rcm=ACoAACYThVgB_8tOg_Lx5-80n_KAGn_StXRR98g">post</a> on Costco being <em>THE</em> protein dealer. </p> <br/><br/>Get full access to Express Checkout at <a href="https://expresscheckout.co/subscribe?utm_medium=podcast&#38;utm_campaign=CTA_4">exp