      <description>
        <![CDATA[ <p>Welcome back to another episode of The Curious Consumer!</p><p>Today we’re talking about the hottest topic right now…..PROTEIN.</p><p>Let’s get one thing straight: protein isn’t just a trend. It’s a fundamental part of our nutrition, and it’s been essential long before it started trending on social media. Whether you’re an athlete, a busy parent, or just someone trying to eat a little healthier, protein plays a crucial role in how our bodies function and feel.</p><p><strong>In this episode you’ll learn about:</strong></p><p>🧬 What protein actually is (and why it matters)</p><p>📜 The history of protein, from its 19th-century discovery to today</p><p>🍫 The first protein bars and early protein products</p><p>💪 How bodybuilding and diet culture shaped the protein industry</p><p>🏪 Big brand acquisitions and current market trends</p><p>🔮 Insights on the future of protein in our daily diets</p><p></p><p>Don’t forget to like, subscribe, and share your thoughts with us!</p><p></p><p><strong>TIMESTAMPS</strong></p><p>00:00 Introduction to Protein Craze</p><p>00:35 The Ubiquity of Protein in Modern Products</p><p>03:28 Historical Context of Protein</p><p>08:56 The Rise of Protein Isolates</p><p>12:37 Bodybuilding and Protein Supplements</p><p>17:30 Fitness Boom and Protein Products</p><p>19:57 Nostalgia for Early Protein Bars</p><p>21:29 Evolution of Protein Bars in the 2000s</p><p>22:07 The Rise of Protein as a Hero Ingredient</p><p>22:39 Major Acquisitions in the Protein Market</p><p>23:42 Iconic Brands and Candy Replacements</p><p>24:35 Diet Culture and Protein Messaging</p><p>25:18 Quest and Halo Top Era</p><p>26:44 The Proteinization of Foods</p><p>32:02 Big Bets in the Late 2010s</p><p>36:58 The Role of GLP-1 in the Protein Boom</p><p>38:46 Conclusion and Teaser for Part Two</p><p></p><p><strong>🎧 Love the show?</strong> Subscribe to The Curious Consumer wherever you get your podcasts! New episodes drop every week</p><p><strong>📧 Get the inside scoop</strong> Subscribe to <a target="_blank" href="https://open.substack.com/pub/expresscheckout">Express Checkout</a>, our newsletter packed with consumer insights, trends, and exclusive content straight to your inbox. Sign up at expresscheckout.co</p><p><strong>📱 Let’s connect!</strong> Follow us for behind-the-scenes content, quick tips, and more:</p><p>* Instagram: <a target="_blank" href="http://instagram.com/expresscheckout"><strong>@expresscheckout</strong></a></p><p><strong>💬 Join the conversation</strong> Have a product you’re curious about? DM us your questions or drop them in the comments—your topic could be featured in our next episode!</p><p><strong>⭐ Help us grow</strong> If you enjoyed this episode, please rate and review us on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. It helps other curious consumers find us!</p><p><strong>🎯 Got a minute?</strong> Share this episode with a friend who’s always reaching for that energy drink. They might learn something that surprises them!</p><p></p> <br/><br/>Get full access to Express Checkout at <a href="https://expresscheckout.co/subscribe?utm_medium=podcast&#38;utm_campaign=CTA_4">expresscheckout.co/subscribe</a> ]]>
