    <item>
      <title>
        <![CDATA[ Man Cereal, caffeinated chips, and the rise of wellness retail ]]>
      </title>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[ <p>Here we are—our first-ever podcast!!! After yapping via written word for almost 3 years, it’s time to go verbal (visual?) with our new pod, The Curious Consumer.</p><p>In our ~ inaugural ~ episode of The Curious Consumer podcast, we partake in a fun yap sesh about consumer habits, wellness trends, and the coolest (weirdest?) new consumer products. </p><p>Expect a good hearty convo on the behind-the-scenes of trade shows, the wild world of manly cereals, the rise of wellness sections in major retailers like Target, and a preview into the topics we want to cover in future episodes. Whether you're a curious consumer or industry insider, you’ll find something to nerd out over with us on this episode—or, at least, you’ll get a good giggle out of two non-podcast people attempting to podcast. </p><p><strong>Be sure to follow us on social media</strong></p><p><a target="_blank" href="http://instagram.com/expresscheckout"><strong>@expresscheckout</strong></a> on IG</p><p></p><p>Timeline</p><p>00:00 Introduction to The Curious Consumer Podcast</p><p>00:19 Discussing the Concept of Consumerism</p><p>01:20 Exploring the Natural Products Expo</p><p>05:04 Podcast Structure and Content Overview</p><p>05:59 Caffeinated Potato Chips Debate</p><p>08:02 Fly by Jing's Exciting New Collaboration</p><p>10:00 Built Puff's New Sour Flavors</p><p>13:26 Man Cereal</p><p>20:04 Ulta's Expansion into Wellness Products</p><p>21:06 Retailers Expanding Wellness Sections</p><p>21:34 Defining Wellness: A Retail Perspective</p><p>22:14 The Dilution of Wellness Products</p><p>23:37 The Struggles of OG Wellness Brands</p><p>28:31 Ulta and Target's Partnership</p><p>30:24 The Impact of Inflation and Competition on Target</p><p>36:24 The Future of Wellness Products</p><p>39:25 Consumer Empowerment and Wellness</p><p>43:50 Conclusion and Sign Off</p> <br/><br/>Get full access to Express Checkout at <a href="https://expresscheckout.co/subscribe?utm_medium=podcast&#38;utm_campaign=CTA_4">expresscheckout.co/subscribe</a> ]]>
